<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Sistem Pengembalian Buku - Tema Botanical Floral</title>
    <!-- Google Fonts & Font Awesome Icons -->
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Playfair+Display:wght@600;700&family=Poppins:wght@300;400;500;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.4.0/css/all.min.css">
    
    <style>
        :root {
            --deep-berry: #88304E;
            --blush-pink: #E8A0BF;
            --soft-cream: #FFFDF9;
            --sage-green: #527853;
            --alert-red: #C0392B;
            --text-dark: #2D3748;
            --card-bg: #FFFFFF;
            --border-color: #F1D4E5;
        }

        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
            font-family: 'Poppins', sans-serif;
        }

        body {
            background-color: var(--soft-cream);
            color: var(--text-dark);
            padding: 20px;
        }

        /* Container Layout */
        .container {
            max-width: 1200px;
            margin: 0 auto;
        }

        /* Top Bar / Header */
        header {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--deep-berry), #5C2034);
            color: white;
            padding: 20px 30px;
            border-radius: 16px;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            box-shadow: 0 8px 20px rgba(136, 48, 78, 0.15);
            margin-bottom: 25px;
        }

        header h1 {
            font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
            font-size: 22px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 10px;
        }

        .user-badge {
            background-color: var(--blush-pink);
            color: var(--deep-berry);
            padding: 8px 16px;
            border-radius: 30px;
            font-weight: 600;
            font-size: 13px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 8px;
        }

        /* Grid Layout */
        .grid-dashboard {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
            gap: 25px;
            margin-bottom: 25px;
        }

        /* Card Styling */
        .card {
            background-color: var(--card-bg);
            border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
            border-radius: 16px;
            padding: 25px;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.03);
            position: relative;
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        .card::before {
            content: "🌸";
            position: absolute;
            top: -10px;
            right: -10px;
            font-size: 60px;
            opacity: 0.08;
            pointer-events: none;
        }

        .card-title {
            font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
            color: var(--deep-berry);
            font-size: 18px;
            margin-bottom: 18px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 8px;
            border-bottom: 2px solid var(--border-color);
            padding-bottom: 8px;
        }

        /* Stat Cards */
        .stats-wrapper {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
            gap: 15px;
            margin-bottom: 25px;
        }

        .stat-card {
            background-color: #FAF0F4;
            border-left: 4px solid var(--deep-berry);
            padding: 15px;
            border-radius: 10px;
        }

        .stat-card.green {
            background-color: #F0F7F1;
            border-left-color: var(--sage-green);
        }

        .stat-card.red {
            background-color: #FDEDEC;
            border-left-color: var(--alert-red);
        }

        .stat-card h4 {
            font-size: 12px;
            color: #666;
            text-transform: uppercase;
        }

        .stat-card p {
            font-size: 20px;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: var(--text-dark);
            margin-top: 5px;
        }

        /* Form Elements */
        .form-group {
            margin-bottom: 15px;
        }

        .form-group label {
            display: block;
            font-size: 13px;
            font-weight: 500;
            margin-bottom: 6px;
            color: #555;
        }

        .form-control {
            width: 100%;
            padding: 10px 14px;
            border: 1px solid #E2E8F0;
            border-radius: 8px;
            font-size: 14px;
            outline: none;
            transition: 0.3s;
        }

        .form-control:focus {
            border-color: var(--deep-berry);
            box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(136, 48, 78, 0.1);
        }

        /* Dynamic Calculation Box */
        .calc-box {
            background-color: #FFF8FA;
            border: 1px dashed var(--blush-pink);
            border-radius: 10px;
            padding: 15px;
            margin-top: 15px;
        }

        .calc-row {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            font-size: 13px;
            margin-bottom: 8px;
        }

        .calc-row.total {
            border-top: 1px solid var(--border-color);
            padding-top: 8px;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: var(--alert-red);
            font-size: 15px;
        }

        /* Buttons */
        .btn-group {
            display: flex;
            gap: 10px;
            margin-top: 20px;
        }

        .btn {
            padding: 10px 20px;
            border: none;
            border-radius: 8px;
            font-size: 13px;
            font-weight: 600;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: 0.2s;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 6px;
        }

        .btn-primary {
            background-color: var(--sage-green);
            color: white;
        }

        .btn-primary:hover {
            background-color: #416142;
        }

        .btn-secondary {
            background-color: #E2E8F0;
            color: var(--text-dark);
        }

        /* Data Tables */
        table {
            width: 100%;
            border-collapse: collapse;
            font-size: 13px;
        }

        th, td {
            padding: 12px 10px;
            text-align: left;
            border-bottom: 1px solid #F0F0F0;
        }

        th {
            background-color: #FAF0F4;
            color: var(--deep-berry);
            font-weight: 600;
        }

        .badge-status {
            padding: 4px 8px;
            border-radius: 12px;
            font-size: 11px;
            font-weight: 600;
        }

        .badge-danger {
            background-color: #FDEDEC;
            color: var(--alert-red);
        }

        .badge-success {
            background-color: #E8F8F5;
            color: var(--sage-green);
        }

        /* WhatsApp Mockup Box */
        .wa-box {
            background-color: #E5DDD5;
            border-radius: 12px;
            padding: 15px;
            font-size: 13px;
            background-image: radial-gradient(#d3c8be 1px, transparent 1px);
            background-size: 10px 10px;
        }

        .wa-bubble {
            background-color: #FFFFFF;
            border-radius: 0px 12px 12px 12px;
            padding: 12px;
            max-width: 90%;
            box-shadow: 0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
            line-height: 1.5;
        }

        @media (max-width: 768px) {
            .grid-dashboard, .stats-wrapper {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="container">

    <!-- Header Section -->
    <header>
        <h1><i class="fa-solid font-awesome-logo-full">🌸</i> Sistem Informasi Perpustakaan Floral</h1>
        <div class="user-badge">
            <i class="fa-solid fa-user-gear"></i> Staf: Selfiana B. (NPM: 29411029)
        </div>
    </header>

    <!-- Ringkasan Statistik -->
    <div class="stats-wrapper">
        <div class="stat-card">
            <h4>Buku Dipinjam Hari Ini</h4>
            <p>42 Buku</p>
        </div>
        <div class="stat-card green">
            <h4>Jatuh Tempo Hari Ini (H-0)</h4>
            <p>8 Buku</p>
        </div>
        <div class="stat-card red">
            <h4>Terlambat / Menunggak</h4>
            <p>5 Buku</p>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Main Grid Dashboard -->
    <div class="grid-dashboard">

        <!-- Column 1: Form Transaksi Pengembalian Buku -->
        <div class="card">
            <div class="card-title">
                <i class="fa-solid fa-receipt"></i> Form Pengembalian & Perhitungan Denda
            </div>

            <div class="form-group">
                <label><i class="fa-solid fa-id-card"></i> NPM / Nama Mahasiswa</label>
                <input type="text" class="form-control" value="29411029 - Selfiana B." readonly>
            </div>

            <div class="form-group">
                <label><i class="fa-solid fa-book"></i> Kode / Judul Buku</label>
                <input type="text" class="form-control" value="BK-088 - Design Patterns Perangkat Lunak" readonly>
            </div>

            <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 10px;">
                <div class="form-group">
                    <label>Tanggal Pinjam</label>
                    <input type="date" class="form-control" value="2026-10-03" readonly>
                </div>
                <div class="form-group">
                    <label>Batas Jatuh Tempo</label>
                    <input type="date" class="form-control" value="2026-10-10" readonly>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="form-group">
                <label>Tanggal Dikembalikan (Hari Ini)</label>
                <input type="date" class="form-control" value="2026-10-12">
            </div>

            <!-- Dynamic Logic Box -->
            <div class="calc-box">
                <div class="calc-row">
                    <span>Status Keterlambatan:</span>
                    <span style="color: var(--alert-red); font-weight: 600;">2 Hari Terlambat</span>
                </div>
                <div class="calc-row">
                    <span>Tarif Denda / Hari:</span>
                    <span>Rp 1.000</span>
                </div>
                <div class="calc-row total">
                    <span>Total Denda Administrasi:</span>
                    <span>Rp 2.000</span>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="btn-group">
                <button class="btn btn-primary"><i class="fa-solid fa-check"></i> Selesaikan & Cetak Struk</button>
                <button class="btn btn-secondary"><i class="fa-solid fa-xmark"></i> Batal</button>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Column 2: Pesan Otomatis WhatsApp Gateway -->
        <div class="card">
            <div class="card-title">
                <i class="fa-brands fa-whatsapp"></i> Notifikasi Otomatis (WhatsApp Service)
            </div>

            <p style="font-size: 12px; color: #666; margin-bottom: 12px;">
                Pesan pengingat otomatis yang dikirimkan oleh sistem (cron-job) kepada peminjam sebelum tanggal jatuh tempo:
            </p>

            <div class="wa-box">
                <div class="wa-bubble">
                    <strong>🌸 [PERPUSTAKAAN BOTANICAL CAMPUS] 🌸</strong><br><br>
                    Halo, <strong>Selfiana B.</strong> (NPM: 29411029),<br><br>
                    Mengingatkan bahwa masa peminjaman buku berikut akan berakhir <strong>HARI INI</strong>:<br>
                    📖 <i>Analisa Kebutuhan Sistem</i><br>
                    📅 Jatuh Tempo : 12 Oktober 2026<br><br>
                    Mohon segera melakukan pengembalian di loket perpustakaan sebelum pukul 16.00 WIB untuk menghindari denda keterlambatan. 🌿
                    <div style="font-size: 10px; color: #888; text-align: right; margin-top: 5px;">08.00 WIB ✔✔</div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

    </div>

    <!-- Table Section: Real-time Monitoring -->
    <div class="card">
        <div class="card-title">
            <i class="fa-solid fa-list-check"></i> Pemantauan Keterlambatan Real-Time
        </div>

        <table>
            <thead>
                <tr>
                    <th>ID Pinjam</th>
                    <th>Nama Mahasiswa</th>
                    <th>Judul Buku</th>
                    <th>Tgl Kembali</th>
                    <th>Keterlambatan</th>
                    <th>Estimasi Denda</th>
                    <th>Aksi</th>
                </tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody>
                <tr>
                    <td>PJM-2026-001</td>
                    <td>Rina Anggraini</td>
                    <td>Analisa Kebutuhan Sistem</td>
                    <td>10 Oct 2026</td>
                    <td><span class="badge-status badge-danger">2 Hari</span></td>
                    <td>Rp 2.000</td>
                    <td><button class="btn btn-primary" style="padding: 4px 10px; font-size: 11px;">Proses</button></td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td>PJM-2026-004</td>
                    <td>Budi Pratama</td>
                    <td>Algoritma & Pemrograman</td>
                    <td>12 Oct 2026</td>
                    <td><span class="badge-status badge-success">0 Hari (Hari Ini)</span></td>
                    <td>Rp 0</td>
                    <td><button class="btn btn-primary" style="padding: 4px 10px; font-size: 11px;">Proses</button></td>
                </tr>
            </tbody>
        </table>
    </div>

</div>

</body>
</html>